      "No pooled disagreement figure is emitted, on any metric, ever (D8). Nothing in this system consumes one -- \u00a711.2 attaches its only threshold to the iteration saving -- which was checked before the decision, so the withholding costs no decision rule anything. Each headline below is the WORST stratum and names the stratum it came from, which makes the quoted number a true one.",
      "kappa bins kappa_2^26_to_2^52, kappa_ge_2^52 cannot be occupied by any cell this report covers. optimize.HESSIAN_COND_LIMIT is float(EPS) ** -0.5 = 67108864.0, which is the first kappa boundary, and a fit above it reports DEGENERATE_HESSIAN and is therefore outside the both-OK intersection. Zero members there is a fact about the outcome taxonomy, not about the field.",
